1	// `andesim doctor` -- read-only environment health.
2	//
3	// Four sections (artifacts, submodules, toolchain, runtime) plus a Summary
4	// line. The detail strings point at scripts/build_all.sh -- the build entry
5	// point, since the build command lives in that script, not the binary.
6	// After Summary the driver appends an `engines:` readout sourced from F2
7	// discovery -- INFO-tagged, never affecting the exit code (which stays 1 iff
8	// any FAIL row).
